"<b>Firo</b> ngoo ko ɗemngal ngal ngon-ɗaa e mum, ena wiyee kadi ɗemngal "
"toɓɓal.\n"
"\n"
"So aɗa fira ummaade e Engeleere fayde e Pulaar ndeen ko Pulaar woni ɗemngal "
"toɓɓal maa."

